<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">好友邀请你，开始健康记录。</view><view class="notice warn section">独立模拟新用户注册，不改变本人档案，不发生真实微信注册。每个访客只绑定一次，不能邀请自己。</view><view class="card section"><view class="title">邀请标识 {{code}}</view><block wx:if="{{!registered}}"><view class="config-row">模拟访客编号<input value="{{visitorId}}" data-key="visitorId" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">模拟昵称<input value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="20" data-key="nickname" bindinput="input" placeholder="无需填写真实资料"/></view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="register" loading="{{busy}}">模拟首次注册，自动绑定邀请人</button></block><block wx:else><view class="title mt">✓ 注册与绑定已完成</view><view class="caption mt">{{record.nickname}} · {{record.date}}</view><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="another">模拟另一位新用户</button></block></view><button class="btn white section" data-url="/pages/invite/index" bindtap="go">返回邀请记录与奖励</button></view>